insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('78d35ea2-2fd1-59e5-b55b-d8ee6d5708f8', 'wg6-argument-writing-p03', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g6-argument-writing'), null,
        '6-8', $q$Typing Lessons Should Start Early$q$, $q$(1) Students at Ridgeview Middle School type almost every assignment, yet many of them still hunt for each letter one key at a time. (2) Ridgeview's elementary schools should teach keyboarding lessons starting in fourth grade. (3) Students who learn to type correctly can finish written work much faster. (4) ______ a student who types thirty words per minute can type a one-page report in less than half the time it takes a student who types ten. (5) Typing quickly also lets students spend their energy on ideas instead of on finding keys.

(6) Some parents believe young children should practice handwriting instead. (7) Handwriting is important, and it should still be taught. (8) Even so, typing lessons need only fifteen minutes a few times each week. (9) Keyboards come in many colors now, and some even light up.

(10) Typing is a skill students will use in middle school, high school, and beyond. (11) Teaching it early would give every Ridgeview student a strong start.$q$, 'draft')
