   $q$Which transition best fills the blank at the beginning of sentence (8)?$q$, $q$[{"text":"For example,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"example-for-cause-effect"},{"text":"On the other hand,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contrast-for-cause-effect"},{"text":"Before that,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"sequence-for-cause-effect"},{"text":"As a result,","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$As a result,$q$, $q$Because the pool time is free (sentence 7), the only cost left is swim caps, so "As a result" shows that cause and effect. "On the other hand" would wrongly signal that sentence (8) disagrees with sentence (7).$q$, 'draft', '0e1ec56d-5db4-51b9-adde-f1076b0c966a')
